{
  "bodyHash": "RNKFZB+6db0=",
  "content": "<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/0BsNlDT.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"240\"></p><p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/C2JV3xu.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\"></p><p style=\"text-align:center;line-height:36px\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/適用於 Minecraft-1.19 | 1.18-ecebe6?labelColor=2F4858&amp;style=for-the-badge\" width=\"295\" height=\"28\"> <img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/安裝位置-用戶端與伺服器端-ecebe6?labelColor=2F4858&amp;style=for-the-badge\" width=\"240\" height=\"28\"></p><p style=\"text-align:center;line-height:36px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/magnum-torch-forge/files/all?filter-status=1&amp;filter-game-version=2020709689:7498\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://bit.ly/3yrSsw7\" width=\"320\" height=\"28\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/puzzles-lib\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://bit.ly/3jr9xQw\" width=\"215\" height=\"28\"></a></p><p style=\"text-align:center;line-height:36px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/magnum-torch-forge/files/all?filter-status=1&amp;filter-game-version=2020709689:7499\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://bit.ly/3nRXr4m\" width=\"325\" height=\"28\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/fabric-api\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://bit.ly/30lZmFY\" width=\"208\" height=\"28\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/puzzles-lib\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://bit.ly/3jr9xQw\" width=\"215\" height=\"28\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/forge-config-api-port-fabric\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://bit.ly/3clkhvn\" width=\"299\" height=\"28\"></a></p><p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/C2JV3xu.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\"></p><p><span style=\"font-size:20px\"><strong>📖 關於本模組：</strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>Magnum Torch</strong> 新增了三種非常強力的火把，能在超大範圍內防止生物生成。此功能只影響自然生成，因此生怪磚和襲擊事件等仍會正常運作。</span></p><p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/C2JV3xu.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\"></p><p><span style=\"font-size:20px\"><strong>📚 內容說明：</strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">你合成的巨型火把類型決定了它能防止哪些生物生成。請注意，只有新生成的生物會被阻止，已經存在於世界中的生物並不會在放置火把後立即消失！</span></p><ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>鑽石：</strong>所有敵對生物，例如殭屍、骷髏、苦力怕、蜘蛛、夜魅等。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>綠寶石：</strong>被動生物，例如流浪商人和商駝（技術上會影響動物，但實際上不影響，因為動物只在世界生成或繁殖時出現，而這兩者皆不受巨型火把影響）</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>紫水晶：</strong>洞穴與水中生物，例如蝙蝠、所有魷魚、六斑龍魚及所有魚類</span></li>\n</ul><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">更棒的是：每種巨型火把都能完全自訂，包括有效範圍、防止生物生成的形狀（長方體、圓柱體、橢球體）、個別生物的白名單/黑名單，以及封鎖的生物類型（敵對/水中/洞穴/被動）。因此，如果你想要，可以完全改變不同類型的功用，例如讓一種只防止夜魅生成，另一種專門處理流浪商人，第三種則禁用所有魚類。完全由你決定！</span></p><p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/C2JV3xu.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\"></p><p><span style=\"font-size:20px\"><strong>📷 媒體展示：</strong></span></p><table style=\"text-align:center\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/440/542/2022-03-12_15.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"231\"></td>\n<td>  </td>\n<td><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/440/543/2022-03-13_11.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"231\"></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>三種巨型火把，各自防止不同生物生成</strong></td>\n<td>  </td>\n<td><strong>村莊中的綠寶石巨型火把</strong></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/440/544/2022-03-13_11.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"231\"></td>\n<td>  </td>\n<td><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/440/545/2022-03-13_10.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"231\"></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>物品提示會告訴你需要知道的所有重要變數</strong></td>\n<td>  </td>\n<td><strong>合成鑽石巨型火把</strong></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/440/546/2022-03-13_10.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"231\"></td>\n<td>  </td>\n<td><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/440/547/2022-03-13_10.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"231\"></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>合成綠寶石巨型火把</strong></td>\n<td>  </td>\n<td><strong>合成紫水晶巨型火把</strong></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table><p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/C2JV3xu.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\"></p><p><span style=\"font-size:20px\"><strong>💡 常見問題：</strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>問：如何在 Forge 上設定這個模組？</strong><br><strong>答：</strong>安裝我的 <span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/config-menus-forge\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>Config Menus for Forge</strong></span></a> 模組，就可以直接在遊戲中設定！</span></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>問：如何在 Fabric 上設定這個模組？</strong><br><strong>答：</strong>尚未實現直接在遊戲中編輯設定檔的功能。請在世界中執行 <code>/config showfile &lt;modid&gt;</code> 指令，選擇 <code>CLIENT</code> 或 <code>SERVER</code>（取決於模組），然後點擊聊天中出現的檔案名稱（結尾為 .toml），即可在獨立編輯器中手動編輯設定檔。儲存檔案後，設定會在數秒後自動在遊戲中重新載入，無需重新啟動遊戲。</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>問：在哪裡可以下載適用於 Minecraft 1.19 之前版本的 Fabric 模組？</strong><br><strong>答：</strong>舊版下載請前往 <span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/magnum-torch-fabric\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>舊專案頁面</strong></span></a>。</span></span></p><p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/C2JV3xu.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\"></p><p><span style=\"font-size:20px\"><strong>🏆 致謝：</strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Magnum Torch 的開發受到以下啟發與幫助：</span></p><ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/rwtema\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>RWTema</strong></span></a>：從其 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/extra-utilities\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Extra Utilities</span></a> 模組舊版中的巨型火把方塊啟發了本模組</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/nyffuuuh23\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>Nyffuuuh23</strong></span></a>：創作了這些精美的材質</span></li>\n</ul><p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/C2JV3xu.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\"></p><p style=\"text-align:center;line-height:36px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/lunapixelstudios/projects\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=CurseForge&amp;message=LunaPixelStudios&amp;color=ecebe6&amp;labelColor=2F4858&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=curseforge&amp;logoColor=white\" width=\"282\" height=\"28\"></a> <a href=\"https://twitter.com/LunaPixelStudio\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/twitter/follow/LunaPixelStudio?label=Twitter&amp;color=ecebe6&amp;labelColor=2F4858&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=twitter&amp;logoColor=white\" width=\"149\" height=\"28\"></a> <a href=\"https://discord.gg/8ZmhaPPbjE\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/discord/790272037578473512?label=Discord&amp;color=ecebe6&amp;labelColor=2F4858&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=discord&amp;logoColor=white\" width=\"220\" height=\"28\"></a></p><p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/1MOyd2u.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"300\"></p><p style=\"text-align:center;line-height:36px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/fuzs_/projects\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=Fuzs_&amp;color=ecebe6&amp;labelColor=2F4858&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=curseforge&amp;logoColor=white\" width=\"97\" height=\"28\"></a> <a href=\"https://github.com/Fuzss\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=Fuzss&amp;color=ecebe6&amp;labelColor=2F4858&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=github&amp;logoColor=white\" width=\"97\" height=\"28\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UC2l26SuCmCNSCPefpfbCX7Q\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=Fuzs&amp;color=ecebe6&amp;labelColor=2F4858&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=youtube&amp;logoColor=white\" width=\"89\" height=\"28\"></a> <a href=\"https://twitter.com/Fusseel\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=@Fusseel&amp;color=ecebe6&amp;labelColor=2F4858&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=twitter&amp;logoColor=white\" width=\"124\" height=\"28\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.reddit.com%252fuser%252fFusseel\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=u/Fusseel&amp;color=ecebe6&amp;labelColor=2F4858&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=reddit&amp;logoColor=white\" alt=\"Reddit\" width=\"130\" height=\"28\"></a> <img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=Fuzs 0212&amp;color=ecebe6&amp;labelColor=2F4858&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=discord&amp;logoColor=white\" width=\"127\" height=\"28\"></p><p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/C2JV3xu.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\"></p><table style=\"text-align:center\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/config-menus-forge\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/kiHP8s9.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"115\"></a></td>\n<td>  </td>\n<td><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/universal-bone-meal-forge\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/q3CooZb.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"115\"></a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/bag-of-holding-forge\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/8gTQlTt.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"115\"></a></td>\n<td>  </td>\n<td><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/block-runner-forge\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/5rv6nTt.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"115\"></a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/easy-shulker-boxes-forge\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/vz0tBff.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"115\"></a></td>\n<td>  </td>\n<td><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/universal-enchants-forge\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/MynoO6R.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"115\"></a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/sneaky-curses-forge\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/LgxIMFS.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"115\"></a></td>\n<td>  </td>\n<td><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/trading-post\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/UzgNFIB.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"115\"></a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/better-animations-collection\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/OVV5lXk.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"115\"></a></td>\n<td>  </td>\n<td><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/stylish-effects\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/fmWwWkZ.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"115\"></a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table><p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/C2JV3xu.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\"></p>",
